                Unimos design estratégico, código de alta performance e marketing orientado a dados para escalar marcas que lideram o futuro.
            </p>

            <!-- Botões CTA -->
            <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
                <a href="#orcamento" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-semibold text-base shadow-xl shadow-brand-600/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    Calcular Meu Projeto
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="#portfolio" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500 dark:hover:border-brand-500 font-semibold text-base transition-all">
                    Explorar Portfólio
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Estatísticas Animadas -->
            <div id="stats-container" class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">
                        <span class="stat-counter" data-target="180">0</span>+
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Projetos Entregues</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">
                        <span class="stat-counter" data-target="98">0</span>%
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Clientes Satisfeitos</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
